      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[0].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: I never told her I was in the pantry
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[0].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'Mother is lying. She scares me.



'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[2].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Why does he not care about Casper? They used to be almost glued together.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[2].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Casper is dead. And he doesn\u2019t care."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[3].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Why does she stand in the kitchen all day? What about her studies?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[3].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: Is she standing guard over the trapdoor to the pantry?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[4].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: "She\u2019s so mean now, what happened to her?\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[4].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: How is she taking a walk?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[5].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Usually I don\u2019t see him until after noon. Why is he up so early?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[5].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: He should not let grandma take a walk.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[6].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: WOOOOF-Woof-wof
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[6].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: I haven't seen Casper today. I wonder where he is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[7].dayDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Does his leg not hurt anymore? I thought the doctor said it was permanently
        disfigured.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[7].dayDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: "He doesn\u2019t remember the injury. You\u2019d think a life ruining
        injury would be memorable. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[0].nightDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Mother is humming. She seems strange. I don't recognize her voice...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[0].nightDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: "She comforts me like nothing happened. Her voice is warm, but her face
        doesn\u2019t move right. When I blink, she\u2019s closer than before."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[2].nightDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'I can hear my younger brother crying from the walls, why is he upset? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[2].nightDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: MURDERER!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[2].nightDescriptions.Array.data[2]'
      value: He died because of you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[3].nightDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Did she kill Casper? But no... That doesn't make any sense...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[3].nightDescriptions.Array.data[1]'
      value: Wooof-Woof!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'familyMembers.Array.data[4].nightDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Darling, won't you be a sweetheart and go get my medicine for me? Be
        careful though, it can see you
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5392949616740311152, guid: c00d051405a25de489b656c305f6ddfb, type: 3}
